Z||000010||dogtired||01-14-2000||06:03 PM||||No Shirt!<BR>No Shoes!<BR>No Service!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>That Doesn't apply here does it??   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Most of the problems I have seen, seem to be misunderstandings (or communications errors).<BR>From a sellers standpoint, things aren't sold till the moneys in hand, From a buyers standpoint the money went in the mail this morning and I needed the part yesterday! Why isn't it here??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>I have purchased and sold several small items to Fellow Fiero Folks and have had no problems!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Is that called HONOR among theives??   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>YOU ALL, DO GOOD!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||6
